---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { curatedLists } from '../../data/curated-book-lists';
---
<BaseLayout title="Curated Book Lists" description="Purpose-built reading lists for curious people. Know why each book belongs and what to read next.">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Ideas & Literature · Reading paths</p>
    <h1>Curated Book Lists</h1>
    <p class="lead">Not every interesting book needs a place on your reading list. These collections have a purpose: explore a question, build a skill, or open a new intellectual door.</p>
    <p>Each list explains why its books belong together, what each contributes, and where their advice may fall short. A reading path, not a pile of titles.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="collections">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="collections">The collections</h2><span>{curatedLists.length} {curatedLists.length === 1 ? 'reading path' : 'reading paths'}</span></div>
    <div class="collection-grid">
      {curatedLists.map(list => <a class="collection glass-panel" href={`/curated-book-lists/${list.slug}/`}>
        <p class="eyebrow">{list.books.length} books · {list.audience}</p>
        <h3>{list.title}</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">{list.subtitle}</p>
        <p>{list.description}</p>
        <span class="explore">Explore this list <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>)}
    </div>
  </section>
  <aside class="note"><h2>Our selection philosophy</h2><p>A recommendation is a starting point, not a verdict. We distinguish what a book teaches, why it was selected, and what it cannot do. As this library grows, the same book may appear on multiple paths for different reasons.</p></aside>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .hero{max-width:47rem;margin-bottom:3rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}
  h1{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4.3rem);line-height:1.1;margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem}
  .lead{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.4vw,1.55rem);line-height:1.55;color:var(--text-primary)}
  .hero>p:last-child,.collection p,.note p{line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-secondary)}
  .section-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);margin-bottom:1rem}
  .section-heading span{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary)}.collection-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,19rem),1fr));gap:1.2rem}
  .collection{display:flex;flex-direction:column;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:1rem;padding:1.5rem;transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}
  .collection:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--link-color)}.collection:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--link-color);outline-offset:3px}
  .collection h3{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.8rem;margin:.3rem 0}.subtitle{font-weight:600;color:var(--text-primary)!important}
  .explore{color:var(--link-color);font-weight:600;margin-top:auto;padding-top:1.2rem}.note{margin:3rem 0;padding:1.3rem 1.5rem;border-left:3px solid var(--link-color);background:var(--surface-color);border-radius:.5rem}.note h2{font-size:1.1rem}
  @media(max-width:600px){.collection{padding:1.2rem}.section-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:0}}
</style>
